        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/199821262af5cae4baf8d1fc3dd6825d.poster.avif?t=1784648607\" width=940 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/199821262af5cae4baf8d1fc3dd6825d.webm?t=1784648607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/199821262af5cae4baf8d1fc3dd6825d.mp4?t=1784648607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face relentless waves of enemies and master fast, action‑packed runs! </strong>Choose your faction, pick your class, and fight your way through dynamically generated levels all the way to the final boss.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer: Co‑op and Versus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co‑op (up to 4 players):</strong><br>Team up and try to clear all levels together. The host selects the faction, and each player chooses one of four available classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versus (up to 4 vs 4):</strong><br>Compete against each other in fast-paced matches. All classes are available for both teams.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Factions, Eight Classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between <strong>Drones</strong> and <strong>Monsters</strong>, each offering four classes with unique playstyles and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/4d51187ba9b842a2a57ddb8cfce01a7a.avif?t=1784648607\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras_big/4d51187ba9b842a2a57ddb8cfce01a7a.avif?t=1784648607 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Asymmetric Enemy Classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles are asymmetric: Your enemies are the classes from the opposing faction. Each wave challenges you differently and forces you to adapt your build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sandbox-Modus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock classes and abilities in the regular mode, then <strong>create your own custom builds</strong> and experiment freely in the Sandbox.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Paths and Biomes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is unique:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps and levels are randomly assembled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 biomes that affect each faction differently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boss fight awaits at the end of every chapter</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/61b6c453989a4301fb79855e115a68d4.poster.avif?t=1784648607\" width=940 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/61b6c453989a4301fb79855e115a68d4.webm?t=1784648607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/61b6c453989a4301fb79855e115a68d4.mp4?t=1784648607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use upgrades to stay ahead of the ever‑growing enemy waves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five difficulty modes: From beginner‑friendly to <strong>brutal bullet hell</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessibility</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with accessibility in mind:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable ability colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully remappable controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto‑aim and auto‑attack (playable one‑handed)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separate audio sliders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty options</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 factions, each with 4 classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox mode for own class creations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Path-based progression with dynamic level generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades for your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Koop and versus</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/199821262af5cae4baf8d1fc3dd6825d.poster.avif?t=1784648607\" width=940 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/199821262af5cae4baf8d1fc3dd6825d.webm?t=1784648607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/199821262af5cae4baf8d1fc3dd6825d.mp4?t=1784648607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face relentless waves of enemies and master fast, action‑packed runs! </strong>Choose your faction, pick your class, and fight your way through dynamically generated levels all the way to the final boss.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer: Co‑op and Versus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co‑op (up to 4 players):</strong><br>Team up and try to clear all levels together. The host selects the faction, and each player chooses one of four available classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versus (up to 4 vs 4):</strong><br>Compete against each other in fast-paced matches. All classes are available for both teams.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Factions, Eight Classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between <strong>Drones</strong> and <strong>Monsters</strong>, each offering four classes with unique playstyles and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/4d51187ba9b842a2a57ddb8cfce01a7a.avif?t=1784648607\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras_big/4d51187ba9b842a2a57ddb8cfce01a7a.avif?t=1784648607 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Asymmetric Enemy Classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles are asymmetric: Your enemies are the classes from the opposing faction. Each wave challenges you differently and forces you to adapt your build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sandbox-Modus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock classes and abilities in the regular mode, then <strong>create your own custom builds</strong> and experiment freely in the Sandbox.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Paths and Biomes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is unique:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps and levels are randomly assembled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 biomes that affect each faction differently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boss fight awaits at the end of every chapter</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/61b6c453989a4301fb79855e115a68d4.poster.avif?t=1784648607\" width=940 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/61b6c453989a4301fb79855e115a68d4.webm?t=1784648607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968430/extras/61b6c453989a4301fb79855e115a68d4.mp4?t=1784648607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use upgrades to stay ahead of the ever‑growing enemy waves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five difficulty modes: From beginner‑friendly to <strong>brutal bullet hell</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessibility</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with accessibility in mind:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable ability colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully remappable controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto‑aim and auto‑attack (playable one‑handed)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separate audio sliders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty options</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 factions, each with 4 classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox mode for own class creations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Path-based progression with dynamic level generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades for your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Koop and versus</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Creator’s Fall is an action roguelike with various classes, where you can choose between different paths. The goal is to reach and defeat the final boss at the end of the path. Levels are dynamically generated and feature different biomes. You can choose an upgrade after each level up.",
